{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Ollama Model Service Architecture.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Ollama Model Service Architecture.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ollama model service architecture ollama model service architecture","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Ollama Model Service Architecture.md","fileName":"Ollama Model Service Architecture.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Ollama Model Service Architecture","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Local LLM Network Engineering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local LLM Network Engineering","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Ollama Model Service Architecture.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Ollama Model Service Architecture.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ollama model service architecture ollama model service architecture","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Ollama Model Service Architecture.md","fileName":"Ollama Model Service Architecture.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Ollama Model Service Architecture","heading":"Ollama Model Service Architecture","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An Ollama deployment can separate the model-serving container from a web-interface container on a shared network. The service owns downloaded models and exposes an API, while the interface provides model selection and conversational access without embedding inference logic into the browser.\n\nPersistent volumes protect model data across container replacement, and an explicitly published port defines the client boundary. This arrangement is convenient for a lab, but production use still needs authentication, network exposure controls, image maintenance, and resource limits. The separation also lets scripts call the service directly without depending on the web interface.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local LLM Network Engineering","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Ollama Model Service Architecture.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Ollama Model Service Architecture.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ollama model service architecture ollama model service architecture","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Ollama Model Service Architecture.md","fileName":"Ollama Model Service Architecture.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Ollama Model Service Architecture","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local LLM Network Engineering","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}